OL,3,AAI poses huge risks to national
OL,4,Asecurity without guardrails, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FArtificial intelligence (AI) poses
OL,8,F"huge risks" to the UK's national
OL,9,Fsecurity and society without the right
OL,10,Fprotections, a senior minister has
OL,11,Fwarned.
OL,13,FFirst Secretary of State Louise Haigh -
OL,14,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's de facto
OL,15,Fdeputy - told the TUC congress on
OL,16,FTuesday that the government needed to
OL,17,F"heed the warnings" of those "at the
OL,18,Fforefront" of developing the
OL,19,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
