OL,3,AAI poses huge risks to national
OL,4,Asecurity without guardrails, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe added the government was "ready to
OL,8,Fwork with international partners" to
OL,9,Fprioritise public safety and national
OL,10,Fsecurity.
OL,12,FFears about the potential dangers of AI
OL,13,Fhave ramped up in recent days after
OL,14,Fexecutives and current and former staff
OL,15,Fin the field warned the tech could
OL,16,Fendanger humanity.
